=== note on what the three runs show
The failing set of the *same* suite, on the *same* tree and base, was 2, then 5, then 1 case, and the intersection of
the three runs is one case — `run#aWriterTheRunCanPlaceBlocksTheItem`, another item's stable red. That is the item's
own measurement, reproduced from this tree; the lease this change adds is what makes a second suite of *this tree*
refusable and named, and the three run-2 reds that pass in isolation are what a loaded host still costs a suite.
